WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.427
Open a new temporary chat and upload the chapter PDF.

00:00:04.427 --> 00:00:05.313
ChatGPT reads the uploaded chapter · accelerated.

00:00:05.313 --> 00:00:08.813
Write the prompt · fast typing.

00:00:08.813 --> 00:00:09.218
Send the shortcut as the second message.

00:00:09.218 --> 00:00:12.336
ChatGPT processes the prompt and builds the widget · accelerated.

00:00:12.336 --> 00:00:15.985
Inspect the generated widget before using its controls.

00:00:15.988 --> 00:00:20.308
Enter inference for the first definition to demonstrate a terminology error.

00:00:20.308 --> 00:00:24.654
Enter inference for the fixed-parameter calculation definition.

00:00:24.654 --> 00:00:28.774
Enter context for the information available during inference.

00:00:28.774 --> 00:00:32.084
Check all three terms and inspect correct and incorrect feedback.

00:00:32.084 --> 00:00:37.084
Open the hint for the incorrectly named process.

00:00:37.084 --> 00:00:42.487
Open the explanation distinguishing training from inference.

00:00:42.487 --> 00:00:47.275
Replace the first term with training.

00:00:47.275 --> 00:00:52.713
Check the revised answers and inspect the successful feedback.

00:00:52.713 --> 00:00:58.043
Inspect the completed 3/3 result.

00:00:58.043 --> 00:01:05.185
Reset the exercise to practise the terms again.
